    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157920/extras/dcce01180d9201f18e50d99629c125ff.avif?t=1752741501\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a shadowed parallel universe, where the remnants of humanity cling to existence amidst mechanical overlords and nightmarish creatures, a relentless battle for dwindling food and energy supplies rages. In this bleak and unforgiving world, a young girl named Marta embarks on a harrowing journey through desolate landscapes and haunted ruins, driven by the desperate hope of finding her lost family. Each step she takes is fraught with peril, as the line between ally and enemy blurs, and survival becomes a test of both wits and willpower. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157920/extras/2fb4626eb1d96d6948d2be77f27bd384.avif?t=1752741501\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Feature</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival-driven Narrative:</strong> Navigate a parallel universe where robots, bizarre creatures, and humans vie for scarce resources essential for survival. Marta\u2019s quest to find her lost family unfolds against this backdrop of intense competition and evolving alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157920/extras/aa68171c688fb08b526d2574125e26a4.avif?t=1752741501\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management and Strategy:</strong> Strategically manage limited food and energy sources crucial for Marta\u2019s survival and progression. Make tough decisions that impact alliances and resource allocation, shaping the course of Marta\u2019s journey and the fate of those she encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157920/extras/160ff8354282116e6dec1a2f251276a2.avif?t=1752741501\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Faction Relationships:</strong> Forge alliances or navigate rivalries with robots, creatures, and human factions, each with distinct goals and ideologies. Influence faction dynamics through actions and choices, affecting Marta\u2019s path and the overarching narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157920/extras/3e3b962776520d62c3373c3d1d7b921b.avif?t=1752741501\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Survival Mechanics:</strong> Engage in survival mechanics that go beyond traditional gameplay, requiring adaptation to fluctuating environments and strategic planning to overcome challenges. Explore diverse landscapes and adapt to their unique challenges to uncover clues about Marta\u2019s family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157920/extras/6c0865421c6644a8d44d55a1182fa974.avif?t=1752741501\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Depth and Exploration:</strong> Delve into Marta\u2019s emotional journey as she confronts loss, courage, and hope amidst a visually rich and atmospheric world. Explore diverse regions that reflect the struggles and resilience of its inhabitants, offering both narrative depth and immersive exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157920/extras/57108dba9efe256202cc770b38f169a0.avif?t=1752741501\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
